# Harness：只排除大体积、可重建的过程产物；保留结构性文件与预览说明。
.harness/art-production/
.harness/research/
.harness/qa/
.harness/artifacts/*
!.harness/artifacts/.gitkeep
.harness/backups/
# --- previews：只保留每个任务的最新一轮，历史迭代稿不入库 ---
# 注意：git 无法在"父目录被排除"的前提下重新包含子项，
# 因此每条规则都遵循「先放行父目录 → 再排除 → 再放行子项」的顺序。
.harness/previews/*
!.harness/previews/.gitkeep

!.harness/previews/TASK-001/
.harness/previews/TASK-001/*
!.harness/previews/TASK-001/r017/
.harness/previews/TASK-001/r017/__pycache__/

!.harness/previews/TASK-002/
!.harness/previews/TASK-006/
!.harness/previews/TASK-007/
!.harness/previews/TASK-008/

!.harness/previews/TASK-009/
.harness/previews/TASK-009/*
!.harness/previews/TASK-009/masters/
!.harness/previews/TASK-009/runtime-candidates/
# 音乐母带（3 个 ~22MB WAV）不入库：属创作资产，需单独备份；
# 游戏内音效走 Resources/.../Audio/TASK009/*.ogg 压缩版。
.harness/previews/TASK-009/masters/Music_*.wav

!.harness/previews/TASK-012/
.harness/previews/TASK-012/*
!.harness/previews/TASK-012/r002-start-transition/

!.harness/previews/TASK-026/
!.harness/previews/TASK-027/
!.harness/previews/TASK-028/
!.harness/previews/TASK-030/

!.harness/previews/TASK-031/
.harness/previews/TASK-031/*
!.harness/previews/TASK-031/r004/

# 预览目录下永不入库的缓存与日志
**/previews/**/__pycache__/
**/previews/**/*.log
.harness/migrations/*/
!.harness/migrations/*.md

# 构建产物（可重建，历史上曾误提交导致仓库膨胀）
/build/
Builds/

# Unity 生成目录
Unity/[Ll]ibrary/
Unity/[Tt]emp/
Unity/[Oo]bj/
Unity/[Ll]ogs/
Unity/UserSettings/
Unity/Bee/
*.csproj
*.sln

# 日志
*.log

# 编译与缓存产物
bin/
obj/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Diagnostics 下的 .NET 构建缓存
**/Diagnostics~/**/bin/
**/Diagnostics~/**/obj/
**/Diagnostics~/**/net10.0/
**/*.csproj.nuget.*
**/project.assets.json
**/project.nuget.cache

# 本机备份数据（历史曾误提交）
Unity/TextToolDatas/

# 本机私密配置：AppID / 云环境 / 广告位不入库（见 SPEC Platform and Persistence）
*.local.json
.env
.env.local
